sequenceDiagram
actor Sales
participant UI as "Interface: UI"
participant API as "mainController: Controller"
participant Service as "orderService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
Sales->>UI: Request cancellation with reason/evidence
UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/cancel
API->>+Service: cancelReservedOrder()
Service->>DB: Check order state, version and picking status
alt Reserved and picking not started
    Service->>DB: Release Reserved and cancel picking work once
    Service->>DB: Set Cancelled and append audit/evidence reference
    DB-->>API: Cancellation completed
    API-->>-UI: Reservation released
else Picking started or shipment dispatched
    Service-->>-API: Cancellation not permitted; use exception/complaint flow
    API-->>UI: Conflict
end

